+### Adding Callbacks
+
+```python
+# Method 1: During agent creation
+agent = LangGraphAgent(
+    name="my-agent",
+    graph=workflow,
+    use_callbacks=True,
+    callbacks=[MyCallback()]
+)
+
+# Method 2: After creation
+agent.add_callback(MyCallback())
+```
