+
+### Performance Metrics
+
+```python
+from cloudbase_agent.server.metrics import track_performance
+
+@track_performance(metric_name="agent_processing")
+async def process_request(data: dict):
+    # Automatically tracks:
+    # - Duration
+    # - Memory usage
+    # - CPU time
+    return await agent.ainvoke(data)
